1
00:00:00,374 --> 00:00:01,744
(Leonard:)How long have
you known Adam?

2
00:00:01,742 --> 00:00:03,172
(Wil:)A few years.
Mm-hmm.

3
00:00:03,177 --> 00:00:06,317
(Leonard:)And what are you
getting him back for?

4
00:00:07,215 --> 00:00:08,945
(Adam:)Let's start with your
name and occupation.

5
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:12,990
(Sheldon:)Dr. Sheldon Cooper,
theoretical physicist, Caltech.

6
00:00:12,987 --> 00:00:16,857
(Adam:)And what is your earliest memory
of the character Spock?

7
00:00:16,858 --> 00:00:21,498
The first episode of Star Trek:
The Original Series I ever saw

8
00:00:21,495 --> 00:00:23,495
was “The Galileo Seven.”

9
00:00:23,497 --> 00:00:26,937
Uh, Spock had just landed
on the planet Taurus II.

10
00:00:26,934 --> 00:00:29,464
Then my brother came in,
sat on my head,

11
00:00:29,470 --> 00:00:32,170
and said, “Eat farts.”

12
00:00:33,441 --> 00:00:34,941
After that day, I was hooked.

13
00:00:34,942 --> 00:00:36,642
On Star Trek,

14
00:00:36,644 --> 00:00:39,674
not my brother's
sphincter-based cuisine.

15
00:00:41,215 --> 00:00:44,115
(Adam:)What was it about Spock
that appealed to you?

16
00:00:44,118 --> 00:00:47,188
(Sheldon:)I think the same thing that
appeals to people everywhere,

17
00:00:47,188 --> 00:00:50,158
(Sheldon:)the dream
of a cold, rational world

18
00:00:50,157 --> 00:00:52,287
(Sheldon:)entirely without human emotion.

19
00:00:52,293 --> 00:00:54,263
(Sheldon:)Spock came

20
00:00:54,262 --> 00:00:56,292
(Sheldon:)from a planet governed
only by logic.

